  "summary": "(Profile)\nSkilled full stack software engineer with passion for technology and learning.\nExperience in all phase of development of embedded systems with good understanding of\nsignal & media processing, mobile applications and back-end server including designing and\ntesting.\nAdditional experience as a software test engineer, with experience in creating test\nspecifications and test suite development.\n\n(Skills)\n• Embedded system development using C/C++ (8years)\n• Hybrid mobile application development using React, React-native, Cordova(5years)\n• Mobile application development using Java and Objective-C(3years)\n• Back-end server development using Spring-framework(2years)\n• Desktop application development using Java(1years)\n\n(Experience)\n\nTECHNICAL STANDARD RESEARCHER & SOFTWARE ENGINEER,\nTELECOMMUNICATIONS TECHNOLOGY ASSOCIATION; BUNDANG, KOREA — 2013-PRESENT\n• Developed technical specifications for IBB (Integrated broadband broadcast) System and\ncontributed to TTA standards. (Also worked as a technical editor)\n• Developed conformant test standard for IBB system\n• Developed various test suites (test case app, test case app library) with different test\nenvironment.(test management server, web service and utility software)\n\nSOFTWARE ENGINEER,\nLG DTV RESEARCH LAB.; SEOUL, KOREA — 2005-2012\n• Developed device drivers for Linux based smart TV platform including HDMI controller,\naudio/video decoders, and video scaler.\n• Designed and developed parts of software for DVR functionality in smart TV, which launched\nglobally in 2010.\n• Designed and developed features on the boot loader.\n• Developed TV framework adaptation modules for Google and successfully launched in\nKorea and United States in 2012.\n\n(Other Projects)\n\nDONORDONUT MOBILE SERVICE (APPLICATION & SERVER) — 2010-2013\n• Developed mobile applications with back-end server for Android and iOS, to help people to\ndonate and promote Non-Governmental Organizations to general public.",
